# Everything the tools generate. These list real paths from the music library,
# so they must never be committed even when a run leaves them in the repo root:
# demangle writes its plan and journal to the working directory, and the plan
# holds one line per file in the library.
demangle-plan.tsv
demangle-journal-*.jsonl
paths.json
data.json
index.html
_now_playing.m3u8
*.m3u8
